          "id": "2c772a5441f6efa012d53ee2e47d55646ab56f83",
          "message": "feat(dsv4): enable Mono decode by default (#2586)\n\n* feat(dsv4): add mono kernels and native execution bindings\n\nAdd V4 persistent layer kernels, lossless weight bindings and target/draft\nexecution plans using existing shared Mono primitives. The runner owns\nvariant arenas and epochs; layers consume native cache and state views.\nRetain independent compressor score strides and verify input/output slots.\n\nMove the original Native module into its canonical package namespace without\nchanging Native computation. Keep deployment installation for later commits.\n\n* feat(dsv4): isolate mono serving and graph lifecycle\n\nKeep admission, cache publication, slot ownership and graph generations in\nthe V4 Mono package. Use the V4.1-style loaded-model wrapper and Native\nlogits/sampling; reuse the shared rollout weight-update refusal.\n\nAdd only the engine seams required for resident weight budgeting, V4 cache\nbinding, safe graph selection and shutdown. Preserve Native forwards and the\nexisting plugin module namespace. Keep the V4 read-only embedding schema\nand settled mHC aux extractor needed by the existing drafter contract.\n\n* feat(dsv4): enable qualified TP8 mono decode\n\nRegister V4 through the existing model-boundary Mono installer and\nATOM_MONO_ENABLE switch. Admit ordinary TP8 C1/C2/C4 and MTP3 target C1/C2\nwith FP8 KV, FP4 index and prefix caching disabled. Bind Native-resolved\nindex schedules without rewriting checkpoint configuration.\n\nKeep DSpark implementation reserved and production-unqualified. Document\nsupported settings and update the moved Native source links.\n\n* fix(dsv4): admit prepared exact C4 tail graphs",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-23T22:52:54+08:00",
          "tree_id": "59afc5ef927533f1cc4c832fc78fc4d3749a754d",
