          "id": "40b487e848b31c01dcd03ddfa021728665d19887",
          "message": "feat(v41): split the mono indexer's rows over the TP ranks (#2693)\n\nIn a token-parallel step each rank scores and selects only the rows it\nowns (token_par.own_rows) and stores every row's pool rows and candidate\nblocks into every rank's copy, then raises the row's IRDY / ICRDY flag on\nevery rank. The attention polls the peer IRDY; the candidate-producing\nlayer's launch ends once every rank's ICRDY is in (k2a.icwait). The FP4\nFULL-layer walk plan is written over the rank's own rows.\n\nThe indexer outputs (IROW, ICAND) live in a new never-zeroed part of the\npeer buffer, PeerBuffer.plain, laid out by peer_layout.plain_layout, so\nevery rank addresses them at one offset and the step clear skips them.\nThe contract declares the peer flags of a token-parallel launch.",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-24T14:42:11+08:00",
          "tree_id": "91335b88ed0b12f101cbfcd1be5a1a91e528f746",
