          "id": "b3a3ea0af398ea0610473fc2f8c8f9229c5e7c82",
          "message": "fix(sglang): keep DSV4 MTP draft on the same SWA ring (#2895)\n\n* fix(sglang): keep DSV4 MTP draft on the same SWA ring\n\nDraft extend wrote the ring at req_pool_indices while decode replay kept the capture-time slot, and the captured graph reused step-0 indices after positions advanced. Key every path off the allocator and refill the decode window from the live position tensor.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(sglang): gather DSV4 draft-extend slots from the allocator\n\nreq_pool_indices is not a ring slot. Draft-extend graph replay now reads the slot prefill published into a device table, so that path does not take a host sync.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
