          "id": "498133ed97f5267b62747db03995ce4edc1d171c",
          "message": "fix(sglang): run MI308 Qwen3.5-35B PTPC on the untuned MoE path (#2779)\n\n* fix(sglang): skip CK MoE block_m=16 on gfx942 PTPC graph capture\n\nThe Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-PTPC-FP8 tuned row selects a CK tile the AITER\nheuristic cannot dispatch, so MI308 accuracy capture dies before serving.\n\n* fix(sglang): run MI308 Qwen3.5-35B PTPC on the untuned MoE path\n\nThe tuned CK block_m=16 row cannot be dispatched, and a runtime patch is\nunnecessary: AITER_BYPASS_TUNE_CONFIG on this case uses the same ASM path\nwithout dropping throughput on a local 1024/128 c32 run.\n\n* fix(sglang): set the PTPC MoE bypass in the accuracy workflow\n\nThe nightly accuracy matrix is the inline list in the workflow, not the\nJSON catalog. Without this env the MI308 PTPC job still captures the\nblock_m=16 CK row and dies.",
