          "id": "b2e8fa9926083930b1787c4c2762c03e2e2bd225",
          "message": "[ATOMesh][CI] Enable Kimi K3 WideEP DPA16/EP16 with MoRI EP and add MoRI cases into nightly runs (#2987)\n\n* Enable Kimi k3 WideEP DPA16/EP16 and add MoRI cases into nightly runs\n\n* Address review: per-role KV_CONNECTOR check, one set filter, shared workflow test helpers\n\npd_matrix.py rejects a KV_CONNECTOR that env.prefill or env.decode sets apart from env.common: pd_server_atom.sh checks the connector with only env.common applied, so a per-role value would skip that check, and the --kv-connector filter can read env.common. The four comma-separated filters share one parse_set_filter, and --kv-connector defaults to ATOMESH_KV_CONNECTOR like the others. The workflow tests share tests/atomesh_workflow_helpers.py for the step lookup, the matrix-step harness and the expression evaluator; the f_b_proj test is renamed to say what it asserts.\n\nSigned-off-by: lcskrishna <lollachaitanya@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Apply the KV connector filter before building cells\n\nSigned-off-by: lcskrishna <lollachaitanya@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: lcskrishna <lollachaitanya@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: JiaoliangYu <Jiaoliang.Yu@amd.com>",
