            "extra": "Run: https://github.com/ROCm/ATOM/actions/runs/42168647527 | Threshold: 0.96 | Baseline: 0.97 | BaselineModel: moonshotai/Kimi-K3.1-Pro + Inferact/Kimi-K3.1-DSpark | BaselineNote: Kimi-K3.1-Pro with the Inferact/Kimi-K3.1-DSpark draft (7 tokens; ReplaySSM is on by default with speculative decoding). Measured GSM8K 5-shot flexible-extract 0.9742 / 0.9735 on MI355X (with level 0, FULL graphs and AITER_CUSTOM_AR_MAX_SIZE, which CI leaves at their defaults); spec-decode is lossless w.r.t. the target, so it shares the target's baseline and threshold. Acceptance over that run 31.3% (3.19 tokens a forward); mtp_accept_threshold 0.25 catches a broken draft, which GSM8K alone cannot. | Docker: rocm/atom-dev:nightly_202611051503 | GPU: AMD Radeon Graphics | VRAM: 288GB | ROCm: 7.2.4 | strict-match: 0.9697 | fewshot: 3 | Model: /models/moonshotai/Kimi-K3.1-Pro"
