          "distinct": true,
          "id": "1d37f8662399f57a8c8aa11f9459dee44659e636",
          "message": "feat(indexer): migrate V4 and V4.1 FP4 scoring to the OPUS config API (#2809)\n\n* Migrate shared V4 and V4.1 FP4 indexing to the OPUS config API\n\n* fix(indexer): select the explicit FlyDSL FP4 writer layout\n\n* fix(indexer): limit shared MQA schedules to decode\n\n* refactor(indexer): share layout names and remove obsolete FP4 bridge buffers\n\n* fix(mono): reselect execution for continuing padded batches\n\n* Support gfx950 V4.1 OPUS MQA cache layout in native and Mono paths\n\n* Fix V4.1 FP4 cache layout identity and runtime selection\n\nResolve the physical index layout at startup and share it with cache allocation, Mono, PAGE transfer roles and persistent cache namespaces. Use the runtime architecture for V4 layout selection and document the OPUS default. Add CPU regressions for layout compatibility and namespace snapshots.\n\n* fix(dsv41): remove obsolete OPUS 4 GiB cache guard\n\n* fix(indexer): isolate OPUS imports and key V4 cache layouts\n\nResolve V4 and V4.1 layout identities at startup and reuse them for cache namespaces, compiled graphs, and V4 writers. Share the architecture/backend policy and defer OPUS API imports until that path is selected.\n\nExercise Mono continuation without GPU imports and trace both FP4 layouts in replicated and token-parallel Mono builds.\n\n* test(config): include index cache layout in CP hash fixture",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-09T11:21:59+08:00",
          "tree_id": "44b5a5a69f38c1643ed342245cd613854bfcf58f",
