          "id": "10b99a085ba46e5b3a125f0114cec7c71e401552",
          "message": "feat(api): strict function tools on /beta/chat/completions (BETA-03) (#3090)\n\n* feat(api): strict function tools on /beta/chat/completions (BETA-03)\n\nA function declaring \"strict\": true has its arguments constrained by its\nparameters schema, as DeepSeek's beta contract describes. Before enqueue,\nwith HTTP 400, every object must list all its properties in required and set\nadditionalProperties: false; every schema must give its type and every array\nits items; definitions live at the top and every $ref points into them;\nminLength, maxLength, minItems, maxItems, patternProperties and formats\nother than DeepSeek's five are refused. The check runs off the event loop\nand remembers recent tools.",
