          "id": "e87b0a52500c68bb6a08dcb02e76f31148f8fbc4",
          "message": "fix(dspark): allocate k draft KV positions for block drafters, not k-1 (#3098)\n\nA serial MTP drafter (EAGLE) writes positions C..C+k-2 (k-1 past len(seq)),\nbut DSpark's block pass writes anchor+1..anchor+k with anchor<=C-1, reaching\nC+k-1 (k positions past len(seq)). The existing lookahead of k-1 left the\nlast position unallocated on a fully accepted step whose last block position\nstarts a new block, causing the draft KV write to land in physical block 0\nvia the zeroed block-table tail.\n\nAdd `block_drafter` kwarg to `draft_kv_lookahead` and pass it from the\nscheduler when DSpark is active. Tests cover the arithmetic and sweep every\nprompt-length residue for both serial and block drafters.",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-09T16:32:58+08:00",
          "tree_id": "ee09ebea6b126082be369f9968ca86a3070c8623",
