          "id": "0abda378be29bf2aec6cf08a1bf6549e4498adee",
          "message": "test(dspark): pass the block pass to _stage_anchors in the served-step test (#3182)\n\n#2582 made DSparkProposer._stage_anchors take the block pass as its first\nargument, and #3091, merged five minutes later, added a test that calls it\nwithout one. main's non-GPU unit tests fail on the three anchor cases since\n5b4fbfdec. Hand the test's fake block in, as both production callers do.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
