          "id": "71c9ab83a084c647c13168869bde3c4826608915",
          "message": "[fix] Build no last-stage embedding for a P/D producer's DSpark draft under PP (#3300)\n\n* fix: build no last-stage embedding for a P/D producer's DSpark draft\n\nA context-only P/D producer never proposes (Drafter.context_kv_only, #3038)\nand skips share_with_target, so under PP the last stage need not hold a copy\nof the target's embedding for it (~2.35 GB BF16 for Kimi-K3, ~0.59 GB per\nGPU at TP4). Ordinary PP speculation still builds one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* review: read kv_transfer_config directly and say who builds the PP embedding\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
